# Everything in this repo is LF in git, and now on disk too.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true hands Windows a CRLF working tree while the
# committed blobs stay LF — so `npx prettier --check` fails locally on all 91
# source files and passes in CI, which is the worst way for a check to behave.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touched.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
